                           <div class=\"d-item-title\" style=\"color:#999;\">排污维护麻烦</div>\n                            <div class=\"d-item-desc\" style=\"color:#999;\">无独立排污口，上下胆水垢<br>杂质沉积不易排出</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"d-item\">\n                            <div class=\"d-item-title\" style=\"color:#999;\">保温性能较好</div>\n                            <div class=\"d-item-desc\" style=\"color:#999;\">节能低耗，加热次数更少</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- 3.0 -->\n                    <div class=\"diagram-col\" style=\"color: #F8B133;\">\n                        <div class=\"d-title\" style=\"background: #F8B133; color: #333;\">3.0时代<br>铂钻鲜水舱</div>\n                        <div class=\"d-item\">\n                            <div class=\"d-item-title\">无镁棒终身防腐</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"d-item\">\n                            <div class=\"d-item-title\">长效阻垢便捷维护</div>\n                            <div class=\"d-item-desc\">内胆+微棒长效抑垢<br>独立排污口<br>便于后期清洁维护</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"d-item\">\n                            <div class=\"d-item-title\">48小时长效保温</div>\n                            <div class=\"d-item-desc\">保温海绵大，性能提升20.6%</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">美的COLMO电热水器</div>\n\n            <div class=\"two-col-layout\">\n                <!-- Left Column -->\n                <div class=\"col-half\">\n                    <div class=\"sub-title\">耐候性提升：石墨烯涂层空调</div>\n                    <p>该产品使用长效防腐耐候石墨烯涂层，使铝箔耐中性盐雾时长延长至300%，热扩散系数提升31%，耐候性提升4倍，获得Intertek长效防腐最高等级认定和国际顶刊《Nature》专题报道。</p>\n                    <div class=\"cert-row\">\n                        <div class=\"cert-col\">\n                            <div class=\"placeholder img-cert\">\n                       